exports[`the default answers produce the same brand system, CSS and decision summary every time > summary 1`] = `
"## Industry Intelligence: Consumer Apps
- Default color mood: warm
- Suggested motion: energetic
- Icon style: solid

## Personality-Derived Design:
- Border radius: pill
- Spacing: balanced
- Contrast: high
- Motion: expressive
- Typography family: humanist

## Audience Optimization: General Consumers
- Formality: casual
- Technical level: low
- Accessibility: high
- Voice tone: friendly, approachable, clear, helpful
- Avoid: technical jargon, complex terms, formal language

## Recommendations:
- Primary color mode: both
- Motion intensity: expressive
- Accessibility target: WCAG AAA
- Suggested display fonts: Baloo 2, Comfortaa, Varela Round
- Suggested body fonts: Nunito, Comfortaa, Quicksand
- Suggested mono fonts: Geist Mono, IBM Plex Mono, Roboto Mono"
`;
